  "embedding_text": "欧盟关税与成员国VAT分开查询\nTARIC整合关税、优惠与贸易救济等措施，并按日向成员国传输数据；它不包含成员国VAT或消费税税率。\nTARIC combines EU tariff and trade measures, including trade defence instruments. National VAT and excise rates are outside TARIC and require separate country-level evidence.\nKeywords: 欧盟, TARIC, 关税, 反倾销, VAT, 进口增值税"
